# Reports as Markdown

When the deliverable is an audit, investigation, review, or other standalone written report:

1. Write the full report to a Markdown file under `/opt/cursor/artifacts/` and copy it to the agent store at `/cursor/stores/self/artifacts/`.
2. In the chat reply, give the user a clickable Markdown link to that file. Do not leave the report only in the chat.
3. Keep the reply short and point at the file. The file is the report.
